Scope and provenance
--------------------
data/power/  are original measurements taken by the author on an NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano
             and are the author's own work.

data/events.csv and data/frame_scores.* are DERIVED tables. Each row carries, for one
video frame, a binary event indicator obtained from the ground-truth annotation of the
source dataset and a scalar content score computed by the author's background-subtraction
front end. No imagery, no pixel data and no annotation masks are redistributed here.

The source videos and their original annotations remain under the licences of their own
distributors and must be obtained from them:
